stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> WaitForSensors
    WaitForSensors --> DetectDirection: sensor + IMU events set
    DetectDirection --> WallFollow: heading locked
    WallFollow --> EvadeClose: close_block ROI fires (red/green or late-game magenta)
    EvadeClose --> WallFollow: 0.5 s reverse + 0.3 s counter-steer done
    WallFollow --> BlockFollow: main block visible
    BlockFollow --> WallFollow: block left frame
    WallFollow --> MagentaFollow: magenta block in line-ROI
    MagentaFollow --> WallFollow: magenta gone
    WallFollow --> Parking: turn_counter ≥ 13
    BlockFollow --> Parking: turn_counter ≥ 13
    MagentaFollow --> Parking: turn_counter ≥ 13
    Parking --> [*]

    classDef wait fill:#ffd6a5,stroke:#cc6600,color:#000
    classDef wall fill:#caffbf,stroke:#2d8a2d,color:#000
    classDef block fill:#a0c4ff,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#000
    classDef magenta fill:#ffc6ff,stroke:#a23ea2,color:#000
    classDef evade fill:#ffadad,stroke:#a83232,color:#000
    classDef park fill:#9bf6ff,stroke:#0a7c8a,color:#000

    class WaitForSensors,DetectDirection wait
    class WallFollow wall
    class BlockFollow block
    class MagentaFollow magenta
    class EvadeClose evade
